Here is the commit message:
OOZIE-2014 TestAuthFilterAuthOozieClient fails after
 OOZIE-1917 (rkanter)

Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by the `TestAuthFilterAuthOozieClient` test failing due to changes made in a previous commit (OOZIE-1917) that likely altered the authentication mechanism or configuration handling, leading to incorrect assumptions in the test about the authentication settings. The test was relying on system properties that were not being set correctly, which resulted in the test not functioning as intended.

